  "note": "In the follow-up for q ≥ ∏_{p≤37, p≠7} p the denominator should be 0.8009t − log t − 1.594, not + 0.07354, needing constant ≈ 7.63; the claim survives. Erratum: In the follow-up for q >= prod_{p<=37, p!=7} p, log q >= 0.8009p1 - log 7 makes the denominator 0.8009t - log t - 1.59439, not the printed + 0.07354, and the constant must be 7.62646, not 6.74849 (= log 84.351 + log 7 - log 0.6924, cube dropped; the printed denominator would need 7.428-7.484). (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_12_37.py`)."
